  "narrative": {
    "text": "UML class diagram of the Security profile. Vulnerability (publishedTime, modifiedTime, withdrawnTime) specialises Core/Artifact. The abstract VulnAssessmentRelationship specialises Core/Relationship, constrains 'to' to exactly one Element, and adds assessedElement, suppliedBy and the three times; it is specialised by CvssV2/V3/V4VulnAssessmentRelationship (score, severity, vectorString), EpssVulnAssessmentRelationship (probability, percentile), ExploitCatalogVulnAssessmentRelationship (catalogType, exploited, locator), SsvcVulnAssessmentRelationship (decisionType) and the abstract VexVulnAssessmentRelationship (vexVersion, statusNotes). The VEX class has four subclasses: VexAffected (actionStatement[1], actionStatementTime), VexFixed, VexNotAffected (justificationType, impactStatement, impactStatementTime) and VexUnderInvestigation. Enumerations: CvssSeverityType, ExploitCatalogType, SsvcDecisionType, VexJustificationType.",
